<path d="M8.602 12.412H7.126L10.96 8.65H2.86V7.534H10.96L7.126 3.754H8.602L12.94 8.092L8.602 12.412Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></a></div></div><div class="hero-col-ct is-right is-hm-tag"><div class="hm-tag">The AI factory company</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section test-section"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-huge"><div class="text-wr"><h2 class="ts-h4 is-mid">Crusoe Managed Inference provides best in class speed, throughput, and reliability. Choose from top open/open-source models or bring your own fine-tuned model for enhanced LLM performance.</h2></div></div></div></section><section class="section is-grid-info"><div class="container-huge"><div class="services-wr"><div class="services-col-main"><h2 class="ts-h2 is-services">Managed<br/>AI services</h2><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6855c1aa175582ee23e0aa19/690fb45aa6b96d00ed19a810_services-iamge.svg" loading="lazy" width="300" alt="" class="services-image"/></div><div class="services-col-content"><div class="services-dd"><div class="services-dd-toggle"><div class="services-dd-heading-wr"><div class="services-dd-heading">Seamless scaling</div></div><div class="embed-icon services-dd-arrow w-embed"><svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
<path d="M8.47 17.815L17.875 27.4L17.875 7.15L20.665 7.15L20.665 27.4L30.115 17.815L30.115 21.505L19.27 32.35L8.47 21.505L8.47 17.815Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div><div class="services-dd-list"><div class="services-dd-content-wr"><p class="services-dd-content-text">Our proprietary inference engine, built with Crusoe&#x27;s MemoryAlloy technology, maintains ultra-low latency and scalable throughput for large-context AI workloads, even at peak demand.</p></div></div></div><div class="divider-wr"><div class="divider-white is-services"></div></div><div class="services-dd"><div class="services-dd-toggle"><div class="services-dd-heading-wr"><div class="services-dd-heading">Breakthrough speed</div></div><div class="embed-icon services-dd-arrow w-embed"><svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
<path d="M8.47 17.815L17.875 27.4L17.875 7.15L20.665 7.15L20.665 27.4L30.115 17.815L30.115 21.505L19.27 32.35L8.47 21.505L8.47 17.815Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div><div class="services-dd-list"><div class="services-dd-content-wr"><p class="services-dd-content-text">Use the intuitive Crusoe Intelligence Foundry to select models, generate API keys, and go to production quickly while delivering accelerated time-to-first-token (up to 9.9x faster).</p></div></div></div><div class="divider-wr"><div class="divider-white is-services"></div></div><div class="services-dd"><div class="services-dd-toggle"><div class="services-dd-heading-wr"><div class="services-dd-heading">Latest models</div></div><div class="embed-icon services-dd-arrow w-embed"><svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
<path d="M8.47 17.815L17.875 27.4L17.875 7.15L20.665 7.15L20.665 27.4L30.115 17.815L30.115 21.505L19.27 32.35L8.47 21.505L8.47 17.815Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div><div class="services-dd-list"><div class="services-dd-content-wr"><p class="services-dd-content-text">Build with top open/open-source models or work with our team to optimize performance for your own fine-tuned model. </p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="divider-white"></div><div class="container-huge"><div class="services-wr"><div class="services-col-main is-slider"><div class="services-overlay"></div><div class="services-slider-heading">Crusoe Intelligence Foundry</div><div class="services-slider-subheading">Explore top-performing models<br/>or <a href="https://www.crusoe.ai/contact-sales" data-wf-native-id-path="d8ab2701-921a-dc9e-5d11-517b0f248461" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="d8ab2701-921a-dc9e-5d11-517b0f248461" class="link-white">bring your own</a></div><div class="services-slider-pg"><div class="slider-arrow"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6855c1aa175582ee23e0aa19/6910350174187cc5e35272a4_dark-slider-prev.svg" loading="lazy" alt=""/></div><div class="slider-arrow"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6855c1aa175582ee23e0aa19/69103501e4f0373e90eb2d48_dark-slider-next.svg" loading="lazy" alt=""/></div></div></div><div class="services-col-content is-slider"><div class="swiper is-services w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="swiper-wrapper is-services w-dyn-items"><div data-order="" role="listitem" class="swiper-slide is-services w-dyn-item"><a data-wf-native-id-path="5a8a46a7-3152-c479-30c8-767440a02766_instance-0" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="5a8a46a7-3152-c479-30c8-767440a02766" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%22691621f557b52f53f1576d3c%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%22691c8dfe9da4f6d686add729%22%7D%5D" href="https://console.crusoecloud.com/request-foundry" target="_blank" class="services-link w-inline-block"><div class="service-icon-wr"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6863cc86499b79ce3ab28f8b/691c8dfa04a314b351f7f1ac