</svg></div></div><div class="services-dd-list"><div class="services-dd-content-wr"><p class="services-dd-content-text">Features high-performance NVIDIA &amp; AMD compute, accelerated storage, and optimized RDMA networking to deploy models up to 20x faster and cut costs by up to 81%.</p></div></div></div><div class="divider-wr"><div class="divider-white is-services"></div></div><div class="services-dd"><div class="services-dd-toggle"><div class="services-dd-heading-wr"><div class="services-dd-heading">Simplified operations</div></div><div class="embed-icon services-dd-arrow w-embed"><svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M8.47 17.815L17.875 27.4L17.875 7.15L20.665 7.15L20.665 27.4L30.115 17.815L30.115 21.505L19.27 32.35L8.47 21.505L8.47 17.815Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div><div class="services-dd-list"><div class="services-dd-content-wr"><p class="services-dd-content-text">Crusoe Managed Kubernetes, Crusoe Managed Slurm, and fault-tolerant Crusoe AutoClusters eliminate operational overhead.</p></div></div></div><div class="divider-wr"><div class="divider-white is-services"></div></div><div class="services-dd"><div class="services-dd-toggle"><div class="services-dd-heading-wr"><div class="services-dd-heading">Reliable and supported</div></div><div class="embed-icon services-dd-arrow w-embed"><svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
