of Odyssey) wearing glasses and a black hoodie." class="quote-author-image"/><div><div class="ts-subtitle--small">Oliver Cameron</div><div class="ts-subtitle--small opacity-50">CEO</div></div></div><div class="logo-q"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6863cc86499b79ce3ab28f8b/689321f2261ecfe0a1113d48_Frame%202147229112.avif" loading="lazy" width="100" height="56" alt="" class="quote-logo"/></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6855c1aa175582ee23e0aa19/68dd18c634826dcba63c5ea5_qutoes-image.svg" loading="lazy" width="42" height="38" alt="" class="embed-icon is-quote-bg"/></div></div><div role="listitem" class="swiper-slide is-quotes w-dyn-item"><div class="quote-slide-wr"><div class="quote-text-wr"><div class="ts-h4 is-quote">Windsurf&#x27;s NVIDIA H100 Tensor Core GPUs on Crusoe have been incredibly reliable with a cluster uptime of 99.98%.</div></div><div class="quote-info-wr"><div class="quote-author-wr"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6863cc86499b79ce3ab28f8b/687f60818bd7a093d98e916b_windsurf-avatar.D1l8V1gj.avif" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" alt="Professional photo of Varun Mohan, Windsurf’s Co-founder and CEO." class="quote-author-image"/><div><div class="ts-subtitle--small">Varun Mohan</div><div class="ts-subtitle--small opacity-50">Co-Founder &amp; CEO</div></div></div><div class="logo-q"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6863cc86499b79ce3ab28f8b/689321dabda2db198a6b13c9_6881347f82f4b4a3a96c084b_windsurf-p-2000.avif" loading="lazy" width="100" height="56" alt="Windsurf company logo." sizes="100px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6863cc86499b79ce3ab28f8b/689321dabda2db198a6b13c9_6881347f82f4b4a3a96c084b_windsurf-p-2000-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6863cc86499b79ce3ab28f8b/689321dabda2db198a6b13c9_6881347f82f4b4a3a96c084b_windsurf-p-2000-p-800.avif 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6863cc86499b79ce3ab28f8b/689321dabda2db198a6b13c9_6881347f82f4b4a3a96c084b_windsurf-p-2000.avif 2000w" class="quote-logo"/></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6855c1aa175582ee23e0aa19/68dd18c634826dcba63c5ea5_qutoes-image.svg" loading="lazy" width="42" height="38" alt="" class="embed-icon is-quote-bg"/></div></div><div role="listitem" class="swiper-slide is-quotes w-dyn-item"><div class="quote-slide-wr"><div class="quote-text-wr"><div class="ts-h4 is-quote">Crusoe has been an outstanding partner from the get-go - all of our in-house machine learning models have been trained on Crusoe Cloud. They provide a level of quality of service, responsiveness, and support for early access programs that we couldn&#x27;t find with any other cloud provider.</div></div><div class="quote-info-wr"><div class="quote-author-wr"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6863cc86499b79ce3ab28f8b/687f60c457063ae614d163ee_pixelcut-avatar.DZTVkG9C.avif" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" alt="Professional photo of Prasanth Veerina (Co-founder of Pixelcut) in a dark T-shirt taking a self-portrait with a DSLR camera." class="quote-author-image"/><div><div class="ts-subtitle--small">Prasanth Veerina</div><div class="ts-subtitle--small opacity-50">Co-Founder</div></div></div><div class="logo-q"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6863cc86499b79ce3ab28f8b/689321e4909a061b97730ba1_Frame%202147229109.avif" loading="lazy" width="100" height="56" alt="" class="quote-logo"/></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6855c1aa175582ee23e0aa19/68dd18c634826dcba63c5ea5_qutoes-image.svg" loading="lazy" width="42" height="38" alt="" class="embed-icon is-quote-bg"/></div></div><div role="listitem" class="swiper-slide is-quotes w-dyn-item"><div class="quote-slide-wr"><div class="quote-text-wr"><div class="ts-h4 is-quote">Crusoe provides the latest NVIDIA hardware, extraordinary support, and overall a great partner to enable our data, training, and inference infrastructure. Crusoe is consistently accommodating to our needs and is not afraid to dive deep in helping us solve hard problems.</div></div><div class="quote-info-wr"><div class="quote-author-wr"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6863cc86499b79ce3ab28f8b/688215000595880657f7bbdd_1738866137420.avif" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" alt="Headshot of Philip Petrakian, Member of Techincal Staff at Odyssey." class="quote-author-image"/><div><div class="ts-subtitle--small">Philip Petrakian</div><div class="ts-subtitle--small opacity-50">Member of Technical Staff</div></div></div><div class="logo-q"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6863cc86499b79ce3ab28f8b/689321f2261ecfe0a1113d48_Frame%202147229112.avif" loading="lazy" width="100" height="56" alt="" class="quote-logo"/></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6855c1aa175582ee23e0aa19/68dd18c634826dcba63c5ea5_qutoes-image.svg" loading="lazy" width="42" height="38" alt="" class="embed-icon is-quote-bg"/></div></div></div></div><div data-slider-arrow="quotes" class="swiper-controls"><div data-slider-arrow="back" class="slider-arrow"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6855c1aa175582ee23e0aa19/68dd1971a6ca25ccef639a1a_arrow-left.svg" loading="lazy" alt=""/></div><div data-slider-arrow="next" class="slider-arrow"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6855c1aa175582ee23e0aa19/68dd1971d0ad282e3c10a9ef_arrow-right.svg" loading="lazy" alt=""/></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section hm-cta"><div class="section-bg-wr"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6855c1aa175582ee23e0aa19/6874fa8602ae6f9dddc48df3_ecd0ee4ff6afac5e58eec5d3e4a69109_CTA-bg.avif" loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1080" alt="" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6855c1aa175582ee23e0aa19/6874fa8602ae6f9dddc48df3_ecd0ee4ff6afac5e58eec5d3e4a69109_CTA-bg-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6855c1aa175582ee23e0aa19/6874fa8602ae6f9dddc48df3_ecd0ee4ff6afac5e58eec5d3e4a69109_CTA-bg-p-800.avif 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com